# 2023王江涛高分写作 - 小作文书信类
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语
# 来源: 2023王江涛高分写作
# 描述: 考研英语小作文书信类写作模板、格式规范与常用表达

{{小作文基本要求}}{{100-120词，10分，15分钟完成。格式包括称呼、正文、结束语、署名。}}{{小作文考查应用文写作能力，书信类是最常见题型，包括建议信、邀请信、感谢信、道歉信、投诉信、推荐信、申请信等。}}

{{书信格式-称呼}}{{Dear Sir/Madam,（不知姓名）/ Dear Professor/Dr. + 姓,（知道头衔）/ Dear Mr./Ms. + 姓,（知道姓名）/ Dear friends/classmates,（群体）}}{{称呼后用逗号，不用冒号。正式信用Dear Sir/Madam，非正式信用Dear + 名字。}}

{{书信格式-结束语}}{{Yours sincerely,（知道姓名）/ Yours faithfully,（不知姓名）/ Best regards,（半正式）/ Yours,（非正式）}}{{结束语首字母大写，后加逗号，另起行写署名。}}

{{书信格式-署名}}{{Li Ming（考研统一署名）/ Zhang Wei（英语二）}}{{不要写真实姓名，按题目要求署名。}}

{{建议信开头}}{{I am writing to express my suggestions/ideas regarding ... / I would like to offer some suggestions concerning ... / It is my pleasure to offer you some suggestions.}}{{建议信开头直接表明写信目的。}}

{{建议信主体}}{{Firstly, I suggest that you should ... / Secondly, it would be beneficial to ... / In addition, I recommend that ... / Finally, you might consider ...}}{{分条列出建议，使用连接词。}}

{{邀请信开头}}{{I am writing to invite you to ... / It is my great pleasure to invite you to ... / On behalf of ..., I cordially invite you to ...}}{{邀请信开头说明邀请事项。}}

{{邀请信主体}}{{The event will be held on + 时间 + at + 地点. / We would be honored if you could ... / The details are as follows: ...}}{{说明活动时间、地点、详情。}}

{{感谢信开头}}{{I am writing to express my sincere gratitude/thanks for ... / I would like to extend my heartfelt appreciation for ... / Thank you so much for ...}}{{感谢信开头表达感谢。}}

{{感谢信主体}}{{Your help/support/guidance meant a lot to me. / I could not have done it without your assistance. / It was incredibly kind of you to ...}}{{具体说明感谢原因。}}

{{道歉信开头}}{{I am writing to apologize for ... / I am truly sorry for ... / Please accept my sincere apology for ...}}{{道歉信开头表达歉意。}}

{{道歉信主体}}{{I understand that my behavior caused you inconvenience. / I assure you that it will not happen again. / To make up for it, I would like to ...}}{{说明原因、保证改进、提出补救措施。}}

{{投诉信开头}}{{I am writing to express my dissatisfaction/disappointment with ... / I am writing to make a complaint about ... / I regret to inform you that ...}}{{投诉信开头表明不满。}}

{{投诉信主体}}{{The product/service failed to meet my expectations. / I would appreciate it if you could look into this matter. / I expect a prompt response and a satisfactory solution.}}{{说明问题并提出解决要求。}}

{{推荐信开头}}{{I am writing to recommend ... to you. / It is my pleasure to recommend ... / I would like to recommend ... for ...}}{{推荐信开头表明推荐对象。}}

{{推荐信主体}}{{He/She is an excellent/outstanding ... / What impressed me most was ... / I am confident that he/she will be an ideal candidate for ...}}{{说明推荐理由。}}

{{申请信开头}}{{I am writing to apply for the position of ... / I would like to apply for ... / I am interested in the opportunity to ...}}{{申请信开头表明申请事项。}}

{{申请信主体}}{{I believe I am well-qualified for this position because ... / My relevant experience includes ... / I have a strong background in ...}}{{说明自身资质和相关经验。}}

{{通知/告示}}{{NOTICE / Announcement: ... / We are pleased to announce that ... / It is hereby announced that ...}}{{通知类小作文格式，标题居中，正文简洁明了。}}

{{备忘录}}{{MEMO / To: ... / From: ... / Date: ... / Subject: ...}}{{备忘录格式，四要素齐全。}}

{{报告}}{{Report on ... / Introduction: ... / Findings: ... / Recommendations: ...}}{{报告类小作文格式，分段清晰。}}

{{常用连接词}}{{Firstly/Secondly/Thirdly / In addition/Furthermore / Moreover/Besides / However/Nevertheless / In conclusion/To sum up / Therefore/Consequently}}{{连接词使文章逻辑清晰。}}

{{常见错误提醒}}{{1.格式不正确 2.称呼与结束语不匹配 3.词数不足或超限 4.语气不当 5.遗漏要点}}{{避免常见扣分点。}}
